    "heading": "As a Multiclass Character",
    "lineStart": 3769,
    "lineEnd": 3772
  },
  "section": "3.225",
  "rulesText": "- Gain the following traits from the Core Rogue Traits table: Hit Point Die, proficiency in one skill of your choice from the Rogue's skill list, proficiency with Thieves' Tools, and training with Light armor.  \n- Gain the Rogue's level 1 features, which are listed in the Rogue Features table."
}
